{"title":"Green Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e Everything You Need to Know About Green Artificial Christmas Trees\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eShop green \u003ca style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" title=\"Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003eartificial Christmas trees\u003c\/a\u003e from King of Christmas to bring a timeless and traditional look to your holiday décor. Designed to replicate the natural beauty of real evergreens, these trees feature rich green tones and a variety of styles and silhouettes to suit your space. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur collection includes a wide range of options, from classic PVC trees to highly realistic designs with advanced PE foliage. Whether you prefer a pre-lit tree for convenience or an unlit option for full customization, each tree is crafted with quality materials for long-lasting use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eExplore our collection of traditional green artificial Christmas trees to find the perfect centerpiece for your home this holiday season.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat is a green artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eA green artificial Christmas tree is a traditional style tree designed to mimic a real Christmas tree. Unlike flocked or colored Christmas trees, green trees offer a classic and traditional look that most Christmas enthusiasts know and love.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhy choose a green artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eGreen artificial Christmas trees are the most popular choice for a traditional holiday aesthetic. Their natural color creates a versatile foundation for decorating, allowing ornaments, lights, and garlands to stand out.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThey are also a great option for those transitioning from a real tree to an artificial one, offering a familiar appearance with the added convenience of long-term use and easy setup.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat styles are available in green Christmas trees?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur green artificial Christmas tree collection includes a wide range of silhouettes, sizes, and designs to suit different spaces.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eChoose from full trees for a traditional, dense look, slim trees for smaller rooms, or sparse trees for a more natural and airy appearance. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat size green Christmas tree should I choose?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe right tree size depends on your space and ceiling height. We recommend allowing 6 to 12 inches of clearance between the top of your tree and the ceiling to leave room for a tree topper and ensure a balanced look. King of Christmas tree heights include the stand.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eTrees between 6.5 to 7.5 feet are among the most popular for standard living rooms, while taller trees are ideal for open spaces or homes with higher ceilings.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eGreen vs. Flocked Christmas Trees: What’s the Difference?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eGreen Christmas trees feature natural evergreen tones and offer a timeless holiday look that can be styled in many different ways.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003ca style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" title=\"Flocked Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/flocked-artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003eFlocked Christmas trees\u003c\/a\u003e, on the other hand, are designed with branches coated in a snow-like material, creating a winter-inspired, decorative appearance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe choice comes down to preference, whether you prefer a classic, natural look or a more seasonal, snow-covered aesthetic.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAre green artificial Christmas trees realistic?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eYes, many green artificial Christmas trees are designed to closely replicate the look of real evergreens. Trees made with PE (polyethylene) needles offer a more lifelike texture and appearance which can be found in our \u003ca style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" title=\"Premium Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/premium-trees\"\u003epremium trees\u003c\/a\u003e or \u003ca title=\"Realistic Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/realistic-trees\"\u003erealistic Christmas trees\u003c\/a\u003e collection, while PVC trees offer a classic, full appearance at a more accessible price point, which can be found in our \u003ca style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\" title=\"Classic Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/classic-trees\"\u003eclassic tree collection\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe King of Christmas green artificial tree collection allows you to choose a tree that aligns with your desired level of realism and overall style.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eExplore our collection to find a green artificial Christmas tree that fits your space and brings your holiday vision to life.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"7-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642909257792,"sku":"YF-T7.5-U","price":279.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-10.jpg?v=1718158754"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 600 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642909388864,"sku":"YF-T7.5-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Yorkshire-Fir-v1_04242c5f-9b81-4149-ad07-5298525c13ae.png?v=1722014825"},{"product_id":"6-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-led","title":"6' King Noble Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree with 450 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6' \/ Green \/ LED","offer_id":28642909945920,"sku":"KNF-T6-L","price":429.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/King-Noble-Fir-v1_169f3774-d549-4ff3-a309-d3be5e3bcb60.png?v=1714672821"},{"product_id":"7-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-unlit","title":"7' King Noble Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Green \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642910044224,"sku":"KNF-T7-U","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-3.jpg?v=1718158508"},{"product_id":"7-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-led","title":"7' King Noble Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Green \/ LED","offer_id":28642910208064,"sku":"KNF-T7-L","price":549.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/King-Noble-Fir-led.png?v=1779243007"},{"product_id":"8-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-unlit","title":"8' King Noble Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Green \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642910404672,"sku":"KNF-T8-U","price":379.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-3_9f3b6f73-20b3-43ae-8a1e-a6149a2169cb.jpg?v=1718158913"},{"product_id":"8-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-led","title":"8' King Noble Fir Artificial Christmas Tree 